{"id":"n2-127","title":"～に沿って (〜ni sotte)","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Along with; in accordance with; following","longExplanation":"The ～に沿って grammar point is used to express that something happens or is done along with, in accordance with, or following a particular line, path, or guideline. It is often used in instructions or explanations. The に沿って is attached to the noun representing the line, path or guideline.","formation":"Noun + に沿って","examples":[{"jp":"川に沿って歩いていくと、橋が見えてきます。","romaji":"Kawa ni sotte aruite iku to, hashi ga miete kimasu.","en":"If you walk along the river, you will see a bridge.","words":[{"surface":"川","vocabId":"1390020","reading":"かわ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"沿っ","vocabId":"1176700","reading":"そう","baseForm":"沿う"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"歩い","vocabId":"1514320","reading":"あるく","baseForm":"歩く"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いく","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"橋","vocabId":"1237410","reading":"はし"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見え","vocabId":"1259140","reading":"みえる","baseForm":"見える"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"き","vocabId":"1221520","reading":"き","baseForm":"くる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3]},{"jp":"このレシピに沿って料理を作れば、間違いありません。","romaji":"Kono reshipi ni sotte ryouri wo tsukureba, machigai arimasen.","en":"If you cook according to this recipe, there will be no mistakes.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"レシピ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"沿っ","vocabId":"1176700","reading":"そう","baseForm":"沿う"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"料理","vocabId":"1554310","reading":"りょうり"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"作れ","vocabId":"1597890","reading":"つくる","baseForm":"作る"},{"surface":"ば","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"間違い","vocabId":"1215320","reading":"まちがい"},{"surface":"あり","vocabId":"1225940","reading":"あり","baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,3,4]},{"jp":"規則に沿って行動しなければなりません。","romaji":"Kisoku ni sotte koudou shinakereba narimasen.","en":"We must act in accordance with the rules.","words":[{"surface":"規則","vocabId":"1223021","reading":"きそく"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"沿っ","vocabId":"1176700","reading":"そう","baseForm":"沿う"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行動","vocabId":"1282100","reading":"こうどう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"なけれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"ば","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":"1899440","reading":"なり","baseForm":"なる"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3]},{"jp":"山道に沿って進むと、小さな神社があります。","romaji":"Yamamichi ni sotte susumu to, chiisana jinja ga arimasu.","en":"If you follow the mountain path, there is a small shrine.","words":[{"surface":"山道","vocabId":"1303090","reading":"やまみち"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"沿っ","vocabId":"1176700","reading":"そう","baseForm":"沿う"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"進む","vocabId":"1365980","reading":"すすむ"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"小さな","vocabId":null},{"surface":"神社","vocabId":"1364670","reading":"じんじゃ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あり","vocabId":"1225940","reading":"あり","baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3]}]}